  "help": "Usage: gunzip [OPTION]... [FILE]...\nProcess gzip streams; no FILE or - reads stdin.\nInput and output use bounded buffers.\n\n{{help:stdout:0}}\n{{help:decompress:0}}\n{{help:test:0}}\n{{help:no-name:0}}\n{{help:quiet:0}}\n{{help:fast:0}}\n{{help:fast:1}}\n{{help:best:0}}\n{{help:help:0}}\n{{help:version:0}}\n\nNamed-file gzip compression requires -cn.\nNamed-file gzip/gunzip decompression requires -c unless testing with -t.\nzcat writes named inputs to stdout by default.\nCompression levels are ignored when decompressing or testing.\nIn-place replacement, saved-name metadata and recursion are unsupported.\n",
